    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h3>收纳空间有限杂乱沉闷</h3>\n<p>客厅的空间虽大，但受老旧的家具与格格不入的沙发布垫影响，沉闷而缺乏生机。狭窄的电视柜储物空间有限，远远不能应对收纳需求，大大小小的模型车、爱藏品只能委身于台面上，拥挤不堪，略显杂乱。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e5/c7/e5c7767059d0c8edca972e43a6fbd8e4.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/93/af/93af13627e39aa75e6de118e9f7764f2.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e5/c7/e5c7767059d0c8edca972e43a6fbd8e4.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/93/af/93af13627e39aa75e6de118e9f7764f2.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "20c1dc300341457d8476159c4851ad4c"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
